<title>JAPAN: Nissan Diesel to issue 15 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Nissan Diesel to issue 15 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Nissan Diesel Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   7	  AMT   15 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.99</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 29.Sep.99</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 14.Oct.96  INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 7.Oct-11.Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  BBB+     LAST NIS   BBB+</p>
<p>The conversion price will be decided on October 4.</p>
</text>
